<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>NEXT TO ME, AGAIN</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">HOW WAS YOUR DAY?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1gLeNkNSztHCwtjijjTK5F</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.959" end="00:18.504">What you say? Not much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.504" end="00:22.015">Fell too deep into your thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.015" end="00:29.263">I hoped maybe what you said is all that I needed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.263" end="00:32.744">Talking like you want something else from me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.744" end="00:36.314">Can't believe you made it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.314" end="00:40.964">Said you'd never change how you call my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.964" end="00:48.964">Now you use it as doubt, to make your way out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.654" end="01:01.180">Watching me slowly die, oh do you feel alive?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.180" end="01:04.803">Pretending like I never cared about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.803" end="01:06.968">You spun me in your lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.968" end="01:14.101">I'm used to how you run away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.101" end="01:17.641">I'm tired of feeling the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.641" end="01:19.912">Whenever you'd come back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.912" end="01:24.810">All broken hearted I'm stuck in your mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.810" end="01:28.075">Tell me you're feeling the same thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.075" end="01:31.404">Is it love that you want? That'll stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.404" end="01:35.790">Or you just lonely at heart and think it's okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.790" end="01:42.238">To be here, next to me again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.238" end="01:45.856">My world is falling apart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.856" end="01:53.555">The way we had it all, too naive to see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.555" end="01:56.115">Believed that you were my all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.115" end="02:01.265">Was it lonely? Tired of seeing the stars, feeling tipsy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.265" end="02:07.186">Thought I could believe, that it'd be easier to leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.186" end="02:10.268">'Cause now I'm alone, was it useless?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.268" end="02:15.217">Time after time I don't know why I feel this way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.217" end="02:19.487">You took it all away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.487" end="02:25.253">I never knew what you would want to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.253" end="02:28.651">I'm tired of feeling the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.651" end="02:30.954">Whenever you'd come back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.954" end="02:36.083">All broken hearted I'm stuck in your mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.083" end="02:39.187">Tell me you're feeling the same thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.187" end="02:42.587">Is it love that you want? That'll stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.587" end="02:47.001">Or you just lonely at heart and think it's okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.001" end="02:51.001">To be here, next to me again</p></div></body></tt>